<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell in Nov 20 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell in Nov 20 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED NOVEMBER 13</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............769,500 up.....2.400</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...703,500 down...3,300</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......470,000 up.......800</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED NOVEMBER 20</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....762,670 up....11,273</p>
<p> Financial companies.......576,890 up.....9,618</p>
<p> New York business loans....42,173 down.....392</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......41,911 down.....392</p>
</text>
